flowchart TD
    Detect["Suspected data exposure or corruption"] --> Stop["Stop the application"]
    Stop --> Preserve["Preserve affected files securely"]
    Preserve --> Assess["Assess affected records and repository history"]
    Assess --> Contain["Restrict exposure / rotate affected credentials"]
    Contain --> Restore["Restore from known-good backup if required"]
    Restore --> Verify["Validate with synthetic data"]
    Verify --> Record["Record actions without personal data"]
